%p
  Hello,

%p
  You are receiving this email because your export has been <strong>completed</strong>.

%p
  Your export (
  =@info[:export].name
  ) for the project
  =link_to @info[:export].project.name, Settings.client_routes.project_url(@info[:export].project_id).to_s
  was processed by
  =Settings.organisation_names.organisation_name
  \.

%p
  Your export is ready to download. The download link is valid until
  =@info[:export].expires_at.utc.iso8601
  \.

%p
  =link_to "Download your export", download_export_url(@info[:export], token: @info[:export].signed_id(purpose: :export_download))

%p
  <strong>Warning:</strong>
  Anyone with the download link can download your export. Do not share this link or forward this email to people who should not have access to the data.

Additional information:
%p
  Date stamp:
  = @info[:datestamp]
%p
  Export ID: #{ @info[:export].id }

Regards,
%br= Settings.organisation_names.organisation_name